# MarkFlow GitIgnore
# Using "Ignore All, Allow Specific" strategy for maximum security

# 1. Ignore everything
*

# 2. Allow Essential Project Files
!.gitignore
!README.md
!README_RU.md
!assets/
!assets/**
!requirements.txt
!.env_example

# 3. Allow Source Code & Structure
!core/
!core/**

# 4. Specific Exclusions (Blacklist within Whitelist)
core/static/vendor/
core/config/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
venv/
.env

# 5. Allow Deployment Folder
!deploy/
!deploy/**

# 6. Exclude User Data & Secrets (CRITICAL)
config/
certbot/
markdown_docs/
!markdown_docs/full_feature_test.md
!markdown_docs/full_feature_test_en.md
markdown_docs/Argument_Documentation.md

# 7. Internal Templates (already covered by core/**, but kept for clarity)
!core/config_example/
!core/config_example/**
